<p data-path-to-node="16"><b>להצטרפות לגדוד יהודה (לחצו או סרקו את הברקוד):</b> <a class="ng-star-inserted" href="https://www.google.com/search?q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScZcpDjlaFVZw-7fI0DVsv53cr8Ox-0osIuvqiE3WAcehakCg/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-hveid="0" data-ved="0CAAQ_4QMahcKEwi_6v-y6oCRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQHA">לחצו כאן להרשמה (טופס מקוון)</a></p>', null, 'https://www.modiin4u.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/image-15.png', 'published', '2025-11-24 07:38:14') on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body, excerpt = excluded.excerpt, featured_image = excluded.featured_image, updated_at = now();
