<p data-path-to-node="14"><b data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="0">מסעדות ואוכל מהיר:</b></p>

<ul data-path-to-node="15">
 	<li>
<p data-path-to-node="15,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">מקדונלדס</b> ו<b data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="10">בורגרראנץ''</b></p>
