<p data-path-to-node="15,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">בורגרס בר</b></p>
</li>
 	<li>
<p data-path-to-node="15,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">ביג אפל פיצה</b></p>
